{
   "name": "Scheduler App's User Message Table",
   "description":  [
        "Defines user app messages that are sent with predefined KIT_SCH",
        "periodic messages.",
        " - The EDS UsrMsgperiod-id enumeration defines the periodic messages",
        "   that can be used",
        " - JsonTblTopicMap.USRMSG_UNUSED_PERIOD_ID defines the value 'period'",
        "   must set to for unused entries",
        "This file is automatically updated by the 'add app to target' process",
        "or it can be manually edited.",
        "The BC_ entries must be first and their indices must match the EDS",
        "UsrMsgPeriodId definitions."
